# Architecture Context Index

Read these in order when getting oriented:

1. `../../README.ctx` — public project entrypoint, purpose, and development workflow
2. `agent-context.ctx` — how to use and maintain the living context
3. `architecture/overview.ctx` — system shape
4. `architecture/scrolls.ctx` — Scroll model
5. `architecture/codex.ctx` — discovery/index/resolution
6. `architecture/runtime.ctx` — runtime and CLI
7. `architecture/shinobi-and-archiq.ctx` — long-term destination
8. `concepts/identity-and-uri.ctx` — identity/addressing
9. `concepts/references-and-execution.ctx` — dependency/execution model
10. `decisions/` — why important architectural choices were made
11. `roadmap/current.ctx` — current priorities
12. `glossary.ctx` — terminology

Use source code and tests to verify current behavior after reading this context.
